Modifications / 修改说明
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This copy is NOT the official Ultralytics release. It is the Rockchip-adapted
fork that adds RK35xx (e.g. RK3588) NPU export support. The modifications
introduce an `export && format == 'rknn'` code path emitting RKNN-friendly
output tensors, chiefly in:

  - ultralytics/nn/modules/head.py   RKNN export branches for the Detect /
                                     Segment / OBB / Pose / Classify heads
  - ultralytics/engine/exporter.py   RKNN export format and `export_rknn()`
  - ultralytics/nn/autobackend.py    RKNN backend flag

These RKNN changes originate from Rockchip (airockchip):
  - https://github.com/airockchip/ultralytics_yolo11
  - https://github.com/airockchip/rknn_model_zoo

本副本**不是** Ultralytics 官方发行版，而是 Rockchip（airockchip）为 RK35xx
（如 RK3588）NPU 导出适配的分支：在 head.py / exporter.py / autobackend.py 等
处新增了 `format == 'rknn'` 导出分支。上述 RKNN 改动来自 Rockchip，见上方链接。

